    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survive. Adapt. Conquer.</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half Alive is a fast-paced, wave-based zombie survival game where every choice counts. Face off against the undead, whether you\u2019re going solo or teaming up with friends. Upgrade your weapons, adapt your strategy, and push your limits to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How Long Can You Last?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing but a simple handgun and a small, confined space. Survive wave after wave of increasingly tougher zombies, earn money, and use it to unlock powerful weapons and expand your battlefield. But be warned\u2014the longer you survive, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.poster.avif?t=1739049998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.webm?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.mp4?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Weapons, Upgrades &amp; Perks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of weapons and enhancements to keep the undead at bay. From pistols to assault rifles, customize your arsenal to fit your strategy. Use upgrade stations to boost your weapons and gain an edge with temporary power-ups and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.poster.avif?t=1739049998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.webm?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.mp4?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer &amp; Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, death isn\u2019t permanent. Teammates can revive you within 30 seconds\u2014keep fighting, or spectate until the next wave. Customize your experience with character and weapon skins as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Face the Horde?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With evolving challenges, random wave types, and continuous updates, Half Alive offers an intense and dynamic survival experience. The undead aren\u2019t waiting\u2014lock and load.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survive. Adapt. Conquer.</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half Alive is a fast-paced, wave-based zombie survival game where every choice counts. Face off against the undead, whether you\u2019re going solo or teaming up with friends. Upgrade your weapons, adapt your strategy, and push your limits to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How Long Can You Last?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing but a simple handgun and a small, confined space. Survive wave after wave of increasingly tougher zombies, earn money, and use it to unlock powerful weapons and expand your battlefield. But be warned\u2014the longer you survive, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.poster.avif?t=1739049998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.webm?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/37b2fffcbdeddc3fb43f740c771c5bff.mp4?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Weapons, Upgrades &amp; Perks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of weapons and enhancements to keep the undead at bay. From pistols to assault rifles, customize your arsenal to fit your strategy. Use upgrade stations to boost your weapons and gain an edge with temporary power-ups and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.poster.avif?t=1739049998\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.webm?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556810/extras/e80f121527c8d4b366dca88c61c41ba2.mp4?t=1739049998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer &amp; Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, death isn\u2019t permanent. Teammates can revive you within 30 seconds\u2014keep fighting, or spectate until the next wave. Customize your experience with character and weapon skins as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Face the Horde?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With evolving challenges, random wave types, and continuous updates, Half Alive offers an intense and dynamic survival experience. The undead aren\u2019t waiting\u2014lock and load.</p>",
